.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt DIARIZE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm diarize
.Nd speaker diarization via pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar audio
.Op Ar whisper_json
.Op Fl -output Ar path
.Op Fl -sidecar Ar path
.Op Fl -num-speakers Ar n
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
identifies speaker turns in a 16kHz WAV file using
.Ql pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
on Apple Silicon Metal Performance Shaders (MPS) when available.
.Pp
Two output modes are supported:
.Bl -tag -width "--sidecar"
.It Sy merge
Merges a dominant speaker label onto each Whisper segment when
.Ar whisper_json
is provided.
.It Sy sidecar
Writes a self-contained acoustic diarization JSON file when
.Fl -sidecar
is passed.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--num-speakers"
.It Fl -output Ar path
Merge-mode output path
.Pq default: Pa <whisper_json>.speaker.json .
.It Fl -sidecar Ar path
Write a self-contained
.Pa diarization.json
to this path.
.It Fl -num-speakers Ar n
Speaker-count hint used as a min/max bracket.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage and exit.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN
.It Ev HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN , Ev HF_TOKEN
Required for downloading and running the gated pyannote diarization model.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr yt-transcribe 1 ,
.Xr ztranscribe 1 ,
.Xr whisper-ctl 8
